+## Cross-session question hint
+
+By default, requests include a short hint with recent `/btw` questions from other
+sessions in the same Pi process. Set `crossSessionHint` to `false` in
+`~/.config/rpiv-btw/config.json` to restrict requests to the current session.
+The configuration also honours `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.
+
+```json
+{ "crossSessionHint": false }
+```
+
+The setting is read for each question. Changing it does not require `/reload`.
